{"id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-seven-tuple-tm.md","title":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm — seven tuple tm","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm — seven tuple tm","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm","display":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm — seven tuple tm","depends_on":["[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-df-seven-tuple-tm","73-definition-7.1"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm — seven tuple tm"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-seven-tuple-tm</span><span>73-definition-7.1</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\">\\(\\sqcup\\)</span> 是本接口固定的空白字符，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathsf L\">\\(L=\\mathsf L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\mathsf R\">\\(R=\\mathsf R\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a> 的两个方向。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\)</span> 为候选七元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lift}_7\">\\(\\operatorname{lift}_7\\)</span> 是下述插入固定空白字符的映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\n\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\n\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(M)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(\\pi_1(M),\\pi_2(M),\\pi_3(M),\\pi_4(M),\\pi_5(M),\\pi_6(M),\\pi_7(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(M)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(\\pi_1(M),\\pi_2(M),\\pi_3(M),\\pi_4(M),\\pi_5(M),\\pi_6(M),\\pi_7(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\n\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}):\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\n\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}):\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留七元组，不将原 TM 参数直接改为八元组。空白字符原先缺失，现作为明确的固定接口参数；插入/删除该固定分量不改变机器运行。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sqcup$ 是本接口固定的空白字符，$\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$；$L=\\mathsf L$、$R=\\ma