","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$C,C'\\in\\mathrm{Config}^{\\mathrm{fin}}_M$，见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]、[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-configurations]]。"},{"id":"bc9ff8728e77d8c2","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是原接口的总函数；$\\mathrm{TM}$、停机与词输出图见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]、[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance]]。"},{"id":"220711a8be5be7e0","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"旧七元组词语言实例中的固定空白字符满足 $\\sqcup\\notin\\mathbf2\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$，见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]。"},{"id":"15bb24af84739cac","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"普通编号固定 $\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]；$\\varphi_e$ 与 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$ 必须使用同一包。词语言类 $\\mathrm{RE}$ 的旧七元组接口固定 $\\sqcup\\notin\\mathbf2\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$，见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]。数值与二进制表示的对应使用 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的同一 $\\beta$。"},{"id":"9cd45cc8e4df82aa","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"旧七元组词语言实例中的固定空白字符满足 $\\sqcup\\notin\\mathbf2\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$，见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]。"}],"outgoing":["a63442026b2f1a9a","0a6da8c909717780"]}